    			\lim_{y \to x_i} \check{K}^{[n-1]}_D (x,y)R(y)\boldsymbol{v}_{i}^R &= \lim_{y \to x_i} \check{A}(x) \Pi_{n-1}  \check{D}(y)R(y)\boldsymbol{v}_{i}^R \\
